{"title":"SWEATSHIRTS \u0026 HOODIES","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-sheets-root=\"1\"\u003eExplore the Datum Dahleez Sweatshirts \u0026amp; Hoodies collection, where luxury meets comfort and style. Discover limited edition designs that elevate your wardrobe.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"w16-logo-sweatshirt","title":"W16 LOGO SWEATSHIRT","description":"\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003eThis grey long-sleeved sweatshirt features the iconic Datum Dahleez logo on the front, while the back features the “W16” graphic. This sweatshirt epitomises luxury and performance and pays homage to Datum Dahleez's heritage and commitment to unparalleled craftsmanship. Made from 85% organic cotton and 15% polyester.\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp class=\"p1\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp\u003eMale model is wearing: L (Model height: 6’1”)\u003c\/p\u003e\r\n\u003cp id=\"EDHKATD\"\u003eFemale model is wearing: M (Model height: 5’8”)\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Datum Dahleez Store","offers":[{"title":"XS","offer_id":49344103121243,"sku":"BU124U102GR1S","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"S","offer_id":49344103154011,"sku":"BU124U102GR0S","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"M","offer_id":49344103186779,"sku":"BU124U102GR0M","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true},{"title":"L","offer_id":49344103219547,"sku":"BU124U102GR0L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"XL","offer_id":49344103252315,"sku":"BU124U102GR1L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"XXL","offer_id":49344103285083,"sku":"BU124U102GR2L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":false},{"title":"XXXL","offer_id":49344103317851,"sku":"BU124U102GR3L","price":130.0,"currency_code":"EUR","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0887\/0726\/8955\/files\/w16-logo-sweatshirt-grey-Final_15.jpg?v=1764251261"},{"product_i